{
  "id": "d8c564c5-3e89-4fba-9e3c-4ba2e51a3f37",
  "name": "Pi-hole DNS failover",
  "description": "EKSPORTERT UTEN HEMMELIGHETER. Bytt e92b188aafdb10c77ef1f09337551d2b7b3bda115e085365 og eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiI2ZWU2MzlmMWUxM2I0NGJiOTNiNTcyYjBhZWJiYTJiNyIsImlhdCI6MTc5MTA2MDM3OSwiZXhwIjoyMTA2NDIwMzc5fQ.HMnoqjP9Lrfd1JewhlrtcjwECsdVUnaCckr_fUqITFA ved import. Hermes gjør DNS-testene og den begrensede Kea-endringen.",
  "active": true,
  "activeVersionId": "9d94e856-69f1-4253-9f6d-e7171392d4ed",
